| id  | type        |
+-----+-------------+
| 101 | Cardiology  |
| 102 | Pediatrics  |
| 103 | Dermatology |
| 104 | Orthopedics |
+-----+-------------+
4 rows in set (0.01 sec)

Creating table for doctor :

mysql> create table doctor(name varchar(20),specialization integer,contact varchar(15),fees decimal(10,2),foreign key (specialization) references specialist(id));
Query OK, 0 rows affected (0.09 sec)

mysql> describe doctor;
+----------------+---------------+------+-----+---------+-------+
| Field          | Type          | Null | Key | Default | Extra |
+----------------+---------------+------+-----+---------+-------+
| name           | varchar(20)   | YES  |     | NULL    |       |
| specialization | int           | YES  | MUL | NULL    |       |
| contact        | varchar(15)   | YES  |     | NULL    |       |
| fees           | decimal(10,2) | YES  |     | NULL    |       |
+----------------+---------------+------+-----+---------+-------+
