view the doctor specialization using join 

mysql> select doctor.name,specialist.type from doctor inner join specialist on doctor.specialization = specialist.id ;
+-----------------+-------------+
| name            | type        |
+-----------------+-------------+
| Himesh Kurmi    | Cardiology  |
| Lucky Pal       | Pediatrics  |
| Nageshwar Patel | Pediatrics  |
| Suraj Kumar     | Pediatrics  |
| Arvind Kumar    | Orthopedics |
+-----------------+-------------+
5 rows in set (0.02 sec)

